# Example Host File for iDRAC Scripts
# Copy this to hosts.txt and add your actual iDRAC addresses
#
# Format:
#   - One hostname or IP address per line
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - Empty lines are ignored
#
# When you run scripts with remove_on_success=True,
# successfully processed hosts will be automatically
# removed from this file.

# Production Servers - Building A
